Third-party components (Zstandard / zstd)
----------------------------------------
OmniComp’s C pipeline calls the Zstandard API. By default the build compiles
zstd from Meta’s sources (vendored under ``third_party/zstd`` as a git
submodule) and links ``libzstd.a`` into ``libomnicomp_pipeline``, so the
resulting shared library does not depend on a separate ``libzstd`` at
runtime. You can instead link against the system libzstd; see the Makefile.

Upstream project and license:
  https://github.com/facebook/zstd

Refer to the zstd distribution for its license terms (BSD / GPLv2 dual license).
